<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">*Correctio for the scenario *<o=
:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">After we move fence_put(entity-=
&gt;last_sched) out of the fini_status check:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">A potential race issue for the =
scenario:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:26.4pt;text-indent:-21.0=
pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2">
<![if !supportLists]><span lang=3D"EN-US"><span style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">1=
.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span lang=3D"EN-US">Drm_sched_entity_fini()=
: it exit right after entity-&gt;job_queue empty, [ but that time scheduler=
 is not fast enough to deal with this entity now ]<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:26.4pt;text-indent:-21.0=
pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2">
<![if !supportLists]><span lang=3D"EN-US"><span style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">2=
.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span lang=3D"EN-US">Drm_sched_entity_cleanu=
p() : it call dma_fence_put(entity-&gt;last_scheduled) &nbsp;[ but this tim=
e entity-&gt;last_scheduled&nbsp; actually points to the fence prior to the=
 real last one ]<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:26.4pt;text-indent:-21.0=
pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2">
<![if !supportLists]><span lang=3D"EN-US"><span style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">3=
.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span lang=3D"EN-US">Scheduler_main() now de=
aling with this entity: it call dma_fence_put(entity-&gt;last_scheduled)&nb=
sp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [&nbsp;&nbsp; Now this fence get double put !!! &nbsp;]<o:p=
></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:26.4pt;text-indent:-21.0=
pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2">
<![if !supportLists]><span lang=3D"EN-US"><span style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">4=
.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span lang=3D"EN-US">Scheduler_main() now ca=
ll dma_fence_get() on the *real* last one !<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">So eventually the real last one=
 fence triggers memory leak and more critical the double put fence cause NU=
LL pointer access
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">/Monk<o:p></o:p></span></p>
